menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_BATTERY_POWER
    bool "Enable battery and low-power policy"
    default n
    help
        Reads the battery gauge and charger pin, derives a bounded charge
        snapshot, and applies the guardian's low-battery warning, low-power
        entry and deep-sleep idle policy. The module only touches power state,
        so a mains-powered device never links it.

endmenu
